---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - AnalytXpert" description="About R.V. Prakash — Analytics Expert & E-commerce Entrepreneur helping Shopify brands find real profit.">
  <div class="container max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">About R.V. Prakash</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground">
        Analytics Expert &amp; E-commerce Entrepreneur
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="mb-16">

      <div class="bg-card p-8 rounded-xl border border-border mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">I've Been Where You Are</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          I'm not a consultant who learned about e-commerce from books. I built, scaled, and ran my own
          e-commerce business—and learned the hard way that revenue doesn't equal profit.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 mb-12">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">The Turning Point</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            In 2008, I launched a niche hobby electronics e-commerce store—starting with just a blog and manual
            payments. I was obsessed with top-line revenue and order volume. By 2011, I had scaled from 5 orders
            a week to 50 orders a day in an incredibly niche space.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-4">
            But revenue didn't tell the whole story. After digging into the real economics—accounting for returns,
            shipping overruns, and true acquisition costs—I realized some of my best-selling products were barely
            profitable. That's when I stopped looking at vanity metrics and started building systems to track
            contribution margin, SKU-level profitability, and true customer acquisition costs. The business
            transformed overnight.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">What I Do Now</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Today, I help Shopify brands avoid the mistakes I made. I bring a unique combination of
            hands-on e-commerce experience and deep analytics expertise to cut through the noise and
            show you where your profit is really coming from.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-4">
            I don't just analyze data—I translate it into clear, actionable decisions that protect margin
            and drive sustainable growth.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Expertise Areas -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Areas of Expertise</h3>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">E-commerce Analytics</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Shopify, Google Analytics, Meta Ads, attribution modeling
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Profit Optimization</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Contribution margin analysis, SKU profitability, unit economics
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Paid Advertising</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Campaign profitability analysis, creative-level ROI, channel optimization
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Business Intelligence</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Data visualization, custom reporting, KPI frameworks
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Experience Highlights -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Experience Highlights</h3>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-6 bg-card rounded-lg border border-border">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="h-12 w-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-2xl">🚀</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">E-commerce Founder</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                  Built and scaled a niche electronics e-commerce business from 5 orders/week to 50 orders/day
                  (2008-2011), managing everything from product sourcing to profitability analysis.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-card rounded-lg border border-border">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="h-12 w-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-2xl">📊</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Analytics Consultant</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                  Helped dozens of Shopify brands uncover hidden profit leaks and optimize their
                  marketing spend based on true contribution margin.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-card rounded-lg border border-border">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="h-12 w-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-2xl">💡</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Strategic Advisor</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                  Specialized in translating complex analytics into simple, actionable insights that
                  founders can implement immediately.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Philosophy -->
      <div class="bg-primary/5 p-8 rounded-xl border border-primary/30 mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">My Approach</h3>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-muted-foreground">
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-foreground">No dashboards.</strong> You don't need another tool to log into.
            You need answers.
          </p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-foreground">No fluff.</strong> I deliver one 1-page report and one 30-minute
            call per month. Clear insights, actionable next steps.
          </p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-foreground">No long-term contracts.</strong> If I don't find at least 2x my fee
            in the first 30 days, you don't pay.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center p-8 bg-card rounded-xl border border-border">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Let's Talk About Your Business</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Book a free 15-minute call. I'll tell you exactly where I think your profit is leaking—no pitch,
        no obligation.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://calendly.com/pracasrv/15min"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-11 px-8 text-sm font-medium bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-md hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors"
      >
        Book a Free Call
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
